  /// anywhere in the current resource details of the recommended action,
  /// which include the volume type, size, IOPS, and throughput. Matching is
  /// case sensitive, and a partial value also matches. For example, gp
  /// matches both gp2 and gp3 volumes, and 100 matches any volume whose size,
  /// IOPS, or throughput contains 100. To filter by volume type, specify the
  /// complete volume type, such as gp3 or io2 . ResourceTagsKey and
  /// ResourceTagsValue Matches when the value appears anywhere in the tags of
  /// the resource. Both filter names search every tag key and tag value.
  /// Matching is case sensitive, and a partial value also matches. For
  /// example, a ResourceTagsKey value of test matches a resource that has a
  /// tag value of test . LookBackPeriodInDays Matches when the lookback
  /// period of the recommended action equals the value. Specify a number of
